{"id":"649437","name":"菜团子","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649437/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"油麦菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"春笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜泥","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"油麦菜清洗干净。","img":"images/649437/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沸水中加点盐，放入油麦菜焯水1分钟。","img":"images/649437/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出过凉。","img":"images/649437/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撰干水分切细。","img":"images/649437/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜搅细。","img":"images/649437/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"春笋（已焯水）搅细。","img":"images/649437/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"干香菇泡发后搅细。","img":"images/649437/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油麦菜、笋、香菇、胡萝卜、虾皮、蒜泥放在大碗里。","img":"images/649437/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加食用油、盐、蚝油拌匀。","img":"images/649437/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取适量馅料用手撰成团，团紧实。","img":"images/649437/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"在玉米粉里滚一圈，裹上玉米粉。","img":"images/649437/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用两手压一压，再在玉米粉里滚一圈，重复几次。","img":"images/649437/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"做好的菜团子。","img":"images/649437/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"垫上玉米叶，上锅蒸12分钟。","img":"images/649437/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蒸好的菜团子，很香。","img":"images/649437/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"来个特写😋","img":"images/649437/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}